  m_Name: BossCastellan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.BossStats
  maxHealth: 75
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 1500
  description: The outer gate's warden-stone, animated by a garrison oath nobody
    was left alive to release it from. It did not abandon its post. It brought the
    post to you.
  tactics: 'The first warded Boss: a 30-point blue ward soaks every hit before its
    health moves - the blue bar is the ward, not the boss. Break it through the steady
    fans, watch the shatter, then the real fight begins at FULL health. Below half
    it is Unbarred: wide fans and offset rings, quicker on the hover. Patience through
    the blue, aggression after.'
  displayName: The Castellan
  difficulty: 2
  sprite: {fileID: 1879355326188070566, guid: 264670a359034f34096ca80f470fe80b, type: 3}
  scale: 1.15
  entrySpeed: 2.2
